<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN" class="search-app"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /><title>搜索「{{q}}」{{#if actor}} @{{actor}}{{/if}} - 《崩坏3》文本搜索</title><meta name="description" content="《崩坏3》对话文本搜索：{{q}}{{#if actor}} @{{actor}}{{/if}}" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/r/static/basic.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/r/static/style.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/r/static/search.css" /></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">转到内容</a><div class="search-box"><h1 style="text-align:center;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">《崩坏3》对话文本搜索</h1><form action="/search/" method="GET"><div class="search-row"><input type="search" name="q" value="{{q}}" placeholder="输入关键词搜索..." autofocus /><button type="submit">搜索</button></div><details class="search-options"{{#if actor}} open{{/if}}><summary>更多选项</summary><input type="search" name="a" value="{{actor}}" placeholder="按角色筛选..." /></details></form>{{#if showInfo}}<p class="search-info">找到约 {{matchTotalCount}} 条匹配{{#if actor}} · 角色「{{actor}}」{{/if}}{{#if showRange}}，显示第 {{rangeStart}}-{{rangeEnd}} 条{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}</div><main id="main-content">{{#if results.length}}{{#each results}}<article class="result-item"><div class="result-header"><a href="{{url}}">{{chapterTitle}} · {{pageTitle}}</a><span class="meta">{{matchCount}} 条匹配</span></div><div class="result-lines">{{#each lines}}<div class="dialog-line{{#if match}} match{{/if}}">{{#if actor}}<span class="dialog-actor">{{{actor}}}：</span>{{/if}}<span class="dialog-content">{{{content}}}</span></div>{{/each}}</div></article>{{/each}}{{#if hasPagination}}<div class="pagination">{{#if prevUrl}}<a href="{{prevUrl}}">上一页</a>{{/if}}{{#if nextUrl}}<a href="{{nextUrl}}">下一页</a>{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}{{else}}<div class="empty">{{#if q}}未找到与「<strong>{{q}}</strong>」{{#if actor}}· 角色「{{actor}}」{{/if}}相关的结果。<br>请尝试其他关键词。{{else}}<span></span>{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}</main><footer id=site_footer><a href="/">首页</a><span>|</span><a href="/about/">关于</a><span>|</span><a href="/search/help">搜索帮助</a><span>|</span><div id=privacy_consent></div></footer><script type="module" src="/r/runtime/common.js"></script></body></html>